  <item>
    <title>EP9：每个去过新疆的人，都会找到属于自己的“阿勒泰”</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6683f7b3cdd230b23bbc2efb</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6683f7b3cdd230b23bbc2efb</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 02 Jul 2024 22:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>「好友记 No.2」</span></p><span></span><p><span>最近看神剧【我的阿勒泰】疯狂上头</span></p><span></span><p><span>或许，每个向往新疆的人，都在寻找属于自己的“阿勒泰”</span></p><span></span><p><span>那里有雪山、草原、小溪、牛羊，还有温暖的人与平静的生活</span></p><span></span><p><span>“你看那颗小草，它不需要有用，自由自在不是也很好？”</span></p><span></span><p><span>就像“文秀”一样，去生活、去爱、去受伤...</span></p><span></span><p><span>（PS：建议听到最后～ 喜欢节目，记得点击订阅！持续收听不迷路😉，欢迎进群参与讨论！二维码直接拉到最下面哦 ⬇⬇⬇）</span></p><span></span><p><span><br></span></p><span></span><h2><strong><span>本期嘉宾 🥂</span></strong></h2><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>侯老师，ISTJ，伟俊の领导，高校教师，援疆支教团团长，新疆旅行爱好者 &amp; 忠实推广者，西辣蛋拌面 &amp; 烤包子杀手</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><br></span></p><span></span><h2><strong><span>全员E人的MC们 🦄</span></strong></h2><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>伟俊，ENFJ，爱好桌游的非典型程序员（时常宣称自己是半个新疆人）</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>小布，ENTJ，爱好攀岩的非典型理工男</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>大楼，ENFJ，爱好养猫的民间舞蹈家</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>后期✂：伟俊</span></p><span></span><p><span><br></span></p><span></span><h2><strong><span>本期Timeline ⏲：</span></strong></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="247">04:07</a> 回忆支教二三事：实际体验竟与想象中完全不同？！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="610">10:10</a> 新疆地理小回顾：“三山夹两盆”&amp;“天山分南北”（死去的高中知识突然攻击我）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="932">15:32</a> 支教+结婚旅行，他们在「大“疆”南北」留下了哪些足迹？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1011">16:51</a> 假期有限，深度游 or 跟团游？景点怎么选？听听他们的「硬核推荐」</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1323">22:03</a> 吃货图鉴！新疆美食排行榜(个人向)大公开，有哪些不容错过的绝佳单品？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1609">26:49</a> 黑话图鉴！新疆餐馆里竟有这样一种“暗语”，不仅能“冒充”正宗新疆人，还能解锁隐藏菜单！</span></p><span></span><p><span><br></span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>前方高能❗️❗️ 大量新疆旅行实拍来袭 📷</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>100%无滤镜，感受真实的新疆之美 ☀️</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span>part 1️⃣ 赛里木湖（冰雹后初晴版）</span></strong></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtKPkcy90ciIKYhaxjVgDLNRi4yl.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>“回首向来萧瑟处，也无风雨也无晴”</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnYGD1tc05BDqKovBuO47tIBPKpd.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>看到湖水斑斓的颜色了吗 ⬆️</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fn_M5dZi21TeXnDfN_biBhzZIUx-.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>这个人开心疯啦 ⬆️</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fm2XF2wZXt5clY8af28LG7kx8O14.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>司机老哥拍的 ⬆️（在新疆哪用请摄影师啊，笑）</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span>part 2️⃣ 伊犁草原（6月初夏天花板）</span></strong></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgBLEC0g3pbH8P5JcJRLRONVwJ5k.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>那拉提观景台 ⬆️</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgD3QmvHvZnr-epegrglXwODMa6W.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>雪莲谷 ⬆️（图片大小不能超过10M [气😠]，原图之后发听友群吧，听友群二维码在最下面⬇⬇⬇）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnN8aPD4-oJov6n4BbT-3XaOzbng.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>恰西草原，主打一个原生态 ⬆️</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuOb0Kxx8qUnkxx5g1P18AQY39ms.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>司机老哥他真的，好有本领，我哭死 😭</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span>part 3️⃣ 其他随手拍（真的很随手版）</span></strong></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoQQUDXuhzspRd3kZIldiHvfnF1X.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>天山神秘大峡谷 ⬆️ ⬇️</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrsEjpLR4i174o74vEKVVkfiQ9qN.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>要不是只有一条路，真的会迷路</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fi0ddgLMi_mrogjrnuQQmgdtLkka.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>坐副驾随手拍的白沙湖 ⬆️ 这“天堂感”狠狠拿捏了</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span>part 4️⃣ 伟俊&amp;侯老师的旅行线路图（供需要的朋友们参考）</span></strong></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fo4WTET_NqLis07tQFLT-ceCa-js.png"></figure><span></span><p><span><br></span></p><span></span><h2><strong><span>📣 半青「好友记」专题正式启动❗️❗️❗️</span></strong></h2><span></span><p><span>大楼、小布、伟俊将邀请💯位朋友做客，分享他们“千奇百怪”的人生选择 &amp; 生活方式</span></p><span></span><p><span>你将听到包括（但不限于）：行业内幕、八卦趣闻、人生经历、情感故事...</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果你对「好友记」有任何想法 / 建议，或希望作为嘉宾参与录制，欢迎在 评论区 或 扫描二维码 进群参与讨论！(听友群二维码在最下面⬇⬇⬇)</span></p><span></span><p><span>也可以私信你喜欢的MC：</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>大楼：Gerina520</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>小布：bruce_20231210</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>伟俊：Great_Handsome_</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>或通过听友邮箱 halfpastyouth2024@gmail.com 反馈，你的声音至关重要～</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fp952RTsLhpgPatuZG9G_d4Z5mCC.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><br></span></p><span></span><h2><strong><span>听完节目想吐槽 or 聊聊？🤔</span></strong></h2><span></span><p><span>欢迎加入听友群！成为杰出半青 👏🏻</span></p><span></span><p><span>这里有同龄 👦🏻 👧🏻 陪你闲聊世间精彩，半青路上不孤单～</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrzFhh6Geg6-i1vQVDS1Vm63UeBU.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
