  <item>
    <title>EP6：不喝酒行不行？酒桌上的我是奴还是驴</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6641cd6cf968fce2cbbc4a2d</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6641cd6cf968fce2cbbc4a2d</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 13 May 2024 12:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>酒是粮食精，越喝越年轻。</span></p><span></span><p><span>酒杯一端，前途更宽；酒杯一提，连升三级。</span></p><span></span><p><span>能喝二两喝半斤，这样的干部最放心；</span></p><span></span><p><span>能喝半斤喝八两，这样的干部要培养。</span></p><span></span><p><span>“今天老样子，来点白的吧？”</span></p><span></span><p><span>领导一开腔，小兵很慌张，明天一起床，又得胃溃疡。</span></p><span></span><p><span>剪不断，理还乱，是应酬。</span></p><span></span><p><span>面对酒桌文化，半青的我们何去何从？</span></p><span></span><p><span>（PS：喜欢节目，记得点击订阅哦！持续收听不迷路）</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>主播介绍 🦄</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>伟俊，ENFJ，爱好桌游的非典型程序员</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>小布，ENTJ，爱好攀岩的非典型理工男</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>大楼，ENFJ，爱好养猫的民间舞蹈家</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>时间轴 ⏲：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="300">05:00</a> 喝到断片，是自愿还是迫不得已？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="384">06:24</a> 见过醉酒后的不体面，面对异性领导的强权，我选择拒绝</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="575">09:35</a> 能喝酒会来事，在互联网行业也会受到青睐吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="669">11:09</a> 当工作能力无法衡量或不再重要时，我们学会了谄媚逢迎</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="815">13:35</a> 明知是糟粕，为何还要参与到酒桌文化之中呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="939">15:39</a> 面对压迫我化身犟驴，将邪恶的种子扼杀在摇篮之中</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1216">20:16</a> 酒因何成为聚会交流的载体角色？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1797">29:57</a> 作为年轻一代，我们会继承和利用酒桌文化达到自己的目的吗？</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>听完节目想吐槽/聊聊？🤔</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎加入听友群！成为杰出半青 👏🏻</span></p><span></span><p><span>这里有同龄小哥哥/小姐姐，闲聊中一起体会世间精彩，半青路上不孤单～</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrzFhh6Geg6-i1vQVDS1Vm63UeBU.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lkYOtXOcfaspZtVu9GnNEs5n3gTm.m4a" length="50002825" type="audio/mp4"/>
